  "prefLabel": "He-W 512.08 Utilization Review and Control",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-06-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 512.08 Utilization Review and Control. The department’s provider program integrity unit shall monitor utilization of ABP services to identify, prevent, and correct potential occurrences of fraud, waste and abuse in accordance with in accordance with He-W 520, 42 CFR 455, and 42 CFR 456.\n\nSource. #11012, INTERIM, eff 1-1-16, EXPIRES: 6-29-16 (from He-W 512.06); ss by #11119, eff 6-29-16",
